<content><![CDATA[<p>Build a kit of modular environment pieces that snap together on a grid, then use it to assemble a small scene.</p>
<h2>Learning Objectives</h2>
<ol>
<li>Plan a modular grid and pivot conventions</li>
<li>Model and texture reusable pieces</li>
<li>Assemble a scene from the kit in a real-time engine</li>
</ol>
